# Everything the panel says about the Mac: connected, disconnected, and the
# long strings the firmware has to fit into its own pixel budget.
NOTE Host disconnected falls back to the local face.
CONFIGURE connected false
ADVANCE 6000
SHOT disconnected

CONFIGURE connected true
CONFIGURE context CODEX
CONFIGURE detail BUILDING SOKKON
ADVANCE 1500
SHOT connected

NOTE A context far longer than the 300 px the firmware reserves for it.
CONFIGURE context REFACTORING THE SIMULATOR HOST FRAMEWORK
CONFIGURE detail REPLAYING SCRIPTED SESSIONS WITH DEVICE FONT METRICS
ADVANCE 1500
SHOT long-strings

NOTE Low battery on charge, drawn on the one-second sensor tick.
CONFIGURE battery_percent 7
CONFIGURE charging true
ADVANCE 1500
SHOT low-battery
